Q46. In Teen Taal from Hindustani music, the Khali beat falls on the ______ matra. 
(a) 1 
(b) 5 
(c) 9 
(d) 13 
Ans.(c) 
 
Q47. Approval by both Houses of Parliament for a National Emergency Proclamation is needed within: 
(a) 1 month 
(b) 3 months 
(c) 6 months 
(d) 9 months 
Ans.(a) 
 
Q48. The 2025 ‘Mangrove Cell’ program is associated primarily with which state? 
(a) Odisha 
(b) Andhra Pradesh 
(c) Maharashtra 
(d) West Bengal 
Ans.(c) 
 
Q49. Non-metallic minerals in India are best described as: 
(a) Scarce for industrial applications 
(b) Mainly gemstones with little industry role 
(c) Abundant and essential for key sectors 
(d) Secondary to metallic minerals in growth 
