numbers is 80, what is the 7th number? 
(a) 81 
(b) 82 
(c) 83 
(d) 84 
Ans.(a) 
 
Q64. What is the average of all integers between 200 and 350 that are exactly divisible by 11? 
(a) 275 
(b) 272 
(c) 286 
(d) 292 
Ans.(a) 
 
Q65. How many kilograms of wheat costing ₹52 per kg must be mixed with 30 kg of wheat costing ₹40 per kg so that 
a 20% gain may be obtained by selling the mixture at ₹54 per kg? 
(a) 18.2 kg 
(b) 21.4 kg 
(c) 24 kg 
(d) 28.5 kg 
Ans.(b) 
 
Q66. A gardener has 80 m of fencing wire. He can use this wire to enclose either a circular lawn or a square lawn. If he 
uses the entire wire in each case, what is the approximate ratio of the area of the circular lawn to the area of the square 
lawn? 
(a) 1 : 1 
(b) 1.21 : 1 
(c) 1.27 : 1 
(d) 1.57 : 1 
