(b) 56.5 
(c) 57 
(d) 57.5 
Ans.(a) 
 
Q61. An item is marked at ₹4,000. A discount offer changes from 12% to 18%. How much extra discount does a 
customer get? 
(a) ₹240 
(b) ₹360 
