proteins associated with neurodegenerative conditions. Disruption of this process through habitual short sleep has 
been tentatively linked to elevated long-term risk of cognitive decline. Simultaneously, REM sleep is integral to', '/question-images/SSC_CGL_T_I_Similar_Paper_Held_p17_q91_0.png', 'A noun clause functioning as the main subject of the sentence.', 'A relative clause modifying the noun ''evidence''.',
            'An introductory prepositional phrase modifying the main clause.', 'A direct object of the verb ''suggested''. 
Ans.(c) 
 
