(d) as she owns the entire department 
Ans.(b)', '/question-images/SSC_CGL_T_I_Similar_Paper_Held_p21_q99_0.png', NULL, NULL,
            NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL,
            2.0, 0.5, 'SSC-CGL-T-I-Similar-Paper-Held-on-24-Sep-2025-S1-English.pdf', 'failed_validation', '["MISSING_CORRECT_ANSWER: Official correct answer option is missing or invalid."]'::jsonb
