through its juridico-administrative machinery and the epistemic authority of demographic science, exercises a 
biopolitical management of population—wherein civic belonging is not an entitlement but a [2] ______, dispensed 
according to hierarchies of productivity, cultural assimilation, and racial fungibility. This apparatus transforms race into', '/question-images/SSC_CGL_T_I_Similar_Paper_Held_p15_q79_0.png', 'prerogative', 'dispensation',
