        ) VALUES (
            'e1f1c7c9-bb86-4cca-8cfd-58123c35fcc5', 'SSC CGL 2023 Tier I Shift 1 (2023-03-06)', 2023, 'Shift 1', 'General Intelligence & Reasoning', 35,
            'A situation is given, followed by two conclusions I and II. Read the situation and both the conclusions carefully and select the correct answer. Situation: Since the past 15 years, 75% of the products in the world’s pottery market comes from Country K. However, the employment in the pottery industry of Country K has been consistently declining by 5-9% every year since the past 3 years. Conclusions: I. Even after declining employment, Country K has enough potters to continue contributing equally to the international market. II. The local demand of pottery in Country K has substantially decreased leading to less interest among potters.', '/question-images/SSC_CGL_6_March_2023_p15_q35_1.png', 'Neither I nor II can be concluded', 'Only II can be concluded',
